  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women, Peace and Security and Humanitarian Action (WPS-HA) Compact</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to take concerted action through a global Compact on Women, Peace and Security and gender-responsive Humanitarian Action in five years by establishing a voluntary monitoring and accountability process, strengthening coordination across existing WPS and HA mechanisms, and promoting financing for and visibility of the WPS-HA agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
